# WP-KEYED-FLATDATA interop harness ignores. Connext rtiddsgen output is produced at build time and
# git-ignored (clean-room); Fast DDS fastddsgen output under fastdds/gen/ is COMMITTED verbatim
# (Apache-2.0; see README.md + docs/provenance.md), only its executables are ignored.

# Connext rtiddsgen-generated type support (clean-room: build-time, never committed)
connext/KeyedFlat.hpp
connext/KeyedFlat.cxx
connext/KeyedFlatPlugin.hpp
connext/KeyedFlatPlugin.cxx
connext/*.idl.*
connext/.gen.stamp

# build artifacts
*.o
*.so
*.dylib

# the built executables
connext/keyed_flat_pub
connext/keyed_flat_sub
fastdds/keyed_flat_pub
fastdds/keyed_flat_sub

# transient capture/decode artifacts (the archived proof pcaps under captures/ are kept)
decode.txt
decode.err
tshark.err
*.out
!captures/
!captures/*.pcap
!captures/*.log
